This module is a port of the `blur3` blurred-background / liquid-glass drawable system from
Telegram for Android (https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram), taken at commit 62b56a07c
(version 12.10.1), together with its helpers `ViewPositionWatcher`, `RenderNodeEffects`,
`RadiiUtils` and the AGSL shader `res/raw/liquid_glass_shader.agsl`.

